{#
	What a GET form or a link carries to change the page in place (owner, 2026-11-05: "just change the data displayed without
	reloading the whole page"; UX rule 8.6a): the page's main area is fetched again and morphed, so focus, scroll and what is
	typed stay, the address follows and Back works. Without JavaScript the same form loads the page. in_place_action: where it asks.
#}hx-get="{{ in_place_action }}" hx-target="#cl-main" hx-select="#cl-main" hx-swap="outerMorph" hx-push-url="true" hx-sync="#cl-main:replace"
